# Decentralized Voting System - Backend (Verification Portal)

Admin-controlled verification portal for voter authentication and token distribution. This system validates voter identities and issues blockchain-based voting tokens.

## Prerequisites

- **Node.js**: 18.18.0 or higher
- **Database**: PostgreSQL 14+ or MongoDB 5+
- **Solana CLI**: For token distribution
- **Admin Wallet**: Funded Solana wallet with SOL for transactions

## Quick Start

```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Setup environment variables
cp .env.example .env

# Run database migrations (if using PostgreSQL)
npm run migrate

# Start development server
npm run dev

# Build for production
npm run build

# Start production server
npm start
```

Server runs on `http://localhost:5000` by default.

## Tech Stack

- **Framework**: Express.js / Next.js API Routes
- **Language**: TypeScript
- **Database**: PostgreSQL with Prisma ORM / MongoDB with Mongoose
- **Authentication**: JWT + Admin credentials
- **File Storage**: AWS S3 (for KYC documents)
- **Blockchain**: @solana/web3.js, @coral-xyz/anchor
- **Email Service**: SendGrid / Nodemailer
- **Rate Limiting**: express-rate-limit
- **Security**: helmet, cors, bcrypt

## Project Structure

```
backend/
├── src/
│   ├── config/
│   │   ├── database.ts           # Database configuration
│   │   ├── solana.ts             # Solana connection setup
│   │   └── env.ts                # Environment variables
│   ├── controllers/
│   │   ├── verificationController.ts  # Voter verification logic
│   │   ├── adminController.ts         # Admin operations
│   │   └── tokenController.ts         # Token distribution
│   ├── models/
│   │   ├── Voter.ts              # Voter schema
│   │   ├── VerificationRequest.ts
│   │   └── Admin.ts
│   ├── routes/
│   │   ├── verification.ts       # Verification endpoints
│   │   ├── admin.ts              # Admin endpoints
│   │   └── token.ts              # Token endpoints
│   ├── services/
│   │   ├── verificationService.ts # Business logic
│   │   ├── tokenService.ts        # Token distribution
│   │   ├── emailService.ts        # Email notifications
│   │   └── storageService.ts      # File storage
│   ├── middleware/
│   │   ├── auth.ts               # JWT authentication
│   │   ├── adminAuth.ts          # Admin authorization
│   │   ├── rateLimiter.ts        # Rate limiting
│   │   └── validator.ts          # Request validation
│   ├── utils/
│   │   ├── solana.ts             # Solana utilities
│   │   ├── crypto.ts             # Encryption helpers
│   │   └── logger.ts             # Logging utility
│   └── app.ts                     # Express app setup
├── tests/
│   ├── verification.test.ts
│   └── token.test.ts
├── .env.example
├── tsconfig.json
└── package.json
```

